roduced": "0"}, {"fixed": "1.3.2"}], "type": "SEMVER"}]}], "aliases": ["CVE-2021-3121", "GHSA-c3h9-896r-86jm"], "details": "Due to improper bounds checking, maliciously crafted input to generated Unmarshal methods can cause an out-of-bounds panic. If parsing messages from untrusted parties, this may be used as a denial of service vector.", "id": "GO-2021-0053", "modified": "2023-02-10T16:51:38Z", "published": "2021-04-14T20:04:52Z", "references": [{"type": "FIX", "url": "https://github.com/gogo/protobuf/commit/b03c65ea87cdc3521ede29f62fe3ce239267c1bc"}], "schema_version": "1.3.1"}]}, {"package": {"name": "github.com/ipfs/go-bitfield", "version": "1.0.0", "ecosystem": "Go"}, "groups": [{"ids": ["GHSA-2h6c-j3gf-xp9r"], "aliases": ["CVE-2023-23626", "GHSA-2h6c-j3gf-xp9r", "GO-2023-1558"], "max_severity": "5.9"}], "vulnerabilities": [{"affected": [{"database_specific": {"source": "https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2023/02/GHSA-2h6c-j3gf-xp9r/GHSA-2h6c-j3gf-xp9r.json"}, "package": {"ecosystem": "Go", "name": "github.com/ipfs/go-bitfield", "purl": "pkg:golang/github.com/ipfs/go-bitfield"}, "ranges": [{"events": [{"introduced": "0"}, {"fixed": "1.1.0"}], "type": "SEMVER"}]}], "aliases": ["CVE-2023-23626", "GO-2023-1558"], "database_specific": {"cwe_ids": ["CWE-1284", "CWE-754"], "github_reviewed": true, "github_reviewed_at": "2023-02-10T19:52:45Z", "nvd_published_at": "2023-02-09T21:15:00Z", "severity": "MODERATE"}, "details": "### Impact\nWhen feeding untrusted user input into the size parameter of `NewBitfield` and `FromBytes` functions, an attacker can trigger `panic`s.\n\nThis happen when the `size` is a not a multiple of `8` or is negative.\nThere were already a note in the `NewBitfield` documentation:\n> ```\n> Panics if size is not a multiple of 8.\n> ````\n\nBut it incomplete and missing from `FromBytes`'s documentation.\n\nThis has been replaced by returning an `(Bitfield, error)` and returning a non nil error if the size is wrong.\n\n### Patches\n- https://github.com/ipfs/go-bitfield/commit/5e1d256fe043fc4163343ccca83862c69c52e579\n\n### Workarounds\n- Ensure `size%8 == 0 && size >= 0` yourself before calling `NewBitfield` or `FromBytes`\n\n### References\n- https://github.com/ipfs/go-unixfs/security/advisories/GHSA-q264-w97q-q778\n", "id": "GHSA-2h6c-j3gf-xp9r", "modified": "2026-09-10T03:49:51.750951929Z", "published": "2023-02-10T19:52:45Z", "references": [{"type": "WEB", "url": "https://github.com/ipfs/go-bitfield/security/advisories/GHSA-2h6c-j3gf-xp9r"}, {"type": "ADVISORY", "url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-23626"}, {"type": "WEB", "url": "https://github.com/ipfs/go-bitfield/commit/5e1d256fe043fc4163343ccca83862c69c52e579"}, {"type": "PACKAGE", "url": "https://github.com/ipfs/go-bitfield"}, {"type": "WEB", "url": "https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2023-1558"}], "schema_version": "1.9.0", "severity": [{"score": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "type": "CVSS_V3"}], "summary": "IPFS go-bitfield vulnerable to DoS via malformed size arguments"}]}, {"package": {"name": "golang.org/x/image", "version": "0.4.0", "ecosystem": "Go"}}]}], "experimental_config": {"licenses": {"summary": false, "allowlist": null}}}, "unfiltered_report": {"results": [{"source": {"path": "/Users/dev/thruline/qualification/open-source-review/20260912-initial/osv-modes-proposal-v1/native-go03/artifacts/osv-mode-dhuhork1/source/go.mod", "type": "lockfile"}, "packages": [{"package": {"name": "github.com/gogo/protobuf", "version": "1.3.1", "ecosystem": "Go"}, "groups": [{"ids": ["GO-2021-0053"], "aliases": ["CVE-2021-3121", "GHSA-c3h9-896r-86jm", "GO-2021-0053"], "experimental_analysis": {"GO-2021-0053": {"called": false, "unimportant": false}}, "max_severity": ""}], "vulnerabilities": [{"affected": [{"database_specific": {"url": "https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2021-0053"}, "ecosystem_specific": {"imports": [{"path": "github.com/gogo/protobuf/plugin/unmarshal", "symbols": ["unmarshal.Gen